 something great will come of it\" - B. Mee \n\nSkydiVeR is the first parachuting simulator for Gear VR. \nCollect your parachuting equipment and board the majestic Lockheed C-130 Hercules aircraft. \n\nLaunch into the sky and literally fly in this high fidelity 3D environment, and land on a cargo ship in the middle of the Pacific Ocean. \n\nWill you be a skydiVeR? Enjoy this breathtaking experience straight from your home!", "short_description": "\"All you need is 20 seconds of insane courage and I promise you something great will come of it\" - B. Mee \n\nSkydiVeR is the first parachuting simulator for Gear VR. Launch yourself into the sky like never before!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.krgames.it/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.krgames.it/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Star Consult S.r.L.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.krgames.it/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "EXPLORATION", "SIMULATION", "SPORTS", "EDUCATIONAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US", "en_AU", "en_CA", "en_ZA", "en_GB"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "986975012245852"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 48, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2525286877701983"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1961795727225768"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2499274420320515"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "611057379340588"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "800498167111311"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "244919563378952"